+# Tasks
+
+## 1. Resilient teardown dispatch
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Add a shared private teardown failure collector and final error raiser that preserve all failures through exception groups when available; verify with focused teardown unit tests.
+- [ ] 1.2 Route request and application-context teardown callbacks through the collector while preserving reverse callback order and async support; verify callback and context-pop tests.
+- [ ] 1.3 Dispatch teardown signal receivers individually through the collector so every receiver runs after failures; verify callback-plus-signal and multi-receiver failure coverage.
+
+## 2. Regression coverage
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Add tests proving request and application-context teardown complete all callbacks and signals and expose grouped errors on supported runtimes; verify with the focused tests.
+- [ ] 2.2 Add tests proving request and application context-local state is restored after teardown errors; verify with `PYTHONPATH=src:.bench-pydeps python3 -m pytest tests/test_appctx.py -q`.
